886:
Mercury vapor lights are prohibited, but the following types of lamps are permitted:
(1) High-pressure sodium (HPS);
(2) Low-pressure sodium (LPS);
(3) Metal halide, maximum 250 watts;
(4) Incandescent lights of 100 watts or less per fixture;
(5) Fluorescent lights 40 watts or less per fixture; and
(6) Alternative types of lights approved by the planning commission as substantially similar in appearance and impact on nearby properties.
(Ord. of 1-24-2012)
